{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Minimal Soundboard for Maximum Control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineered for speed and simplicity, SoundCat gives you total control over your audio triggers. With hotkey support, and usage stats. It's everything you need without the bloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/8fe8323b1ab71b684d709d64201340d4.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Hotkeys</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger sounds anytime, anywhere, even while gaming or tabbed out.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Customizable</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from built-in themes, fonts, and icon styles to match your setup.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usage Stats</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your most-played sounds and monitor your soundboard usage over time.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements just by using SoundCat.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/af7e4099e4a612e2f1385eb88191ff75.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SoundCat Overlay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compact overlay for all your sounds and hotkeys that stays on top of your games and applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/15d443b3e514779568b4e8e5aedaa6bd.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just A Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782290/e29eaccb1eca66301c29f016ca178a551e7084d5.jpg"},{"name":"Muscle Memory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782290/5c089292ff1bcbad485b97a11982f26c859d82ed.jpg"},{"name":"Creating Chaos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782290/14c14355117df6f63f55f16aebc381b42d3ec308.jpg"},{"name":"Addict","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782290/cd0ff41a414510dcba37ac70ba17e54321457d11.jpg"},{"name":"Hearing Voices","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782290/79e54a6f35a18032d196e32830faf4646c5df4ae.jpg"},{"name":"Architect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782290/b8c31a7dceca58b9ec0d3c466906915f75150911.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782290?t=1752254368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/978d82eed6c4613e338140f9a9f159552aba4a81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752254368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/e0b6d0382a6f93d010cedde60a6ccc26756313f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752254368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/e0b6d0382a6f93d010cedde60a6ccc26756313f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752254368","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3815060,"description":""}],"detailed_description"